  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Deathwatch Support",
    "summary": "Your **KILL TEAM** units that have this ability gain three abilities:\n\n- **Furor Tactics**: under the **[devastator doctrine](vsdata:ability/space-marines.combat-doctrines)**, the unit's attacks get **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n- **Malleus Tactics**: under the **[tactical doctrine](vsdata:ability/space-marines.combat-doctrines)**, its attacks get **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)**.\n- **Purgatus Tactics**: under the **[assault doctrine](vsdata:ability/space-marines.combat-doctrines)**, its attacks get **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)** against enemy units within 9\" of it.\n\n**DEATHWATCH ALLIES**: your army may include **DEATHWATCH** units despite their different Chapter keyword, up to 500 points combined, as an exception to **Space Marine Chapters Army Rules**. Unless stated otherwise, a **DEATHWATCH** model cannot be your **WARLORD**, and **KILL TEAM** units can take Enhancements only from this detachment.",
